OL,3,GNEWSAFundraiser to bring 9ft Lara Croft
OL,4,Astatue to city
OL,5,
OL,6,FA crowdfunding campaign has been
OL,7,Flaunched to bring a statue of Lara
OL,8,FCroft to Derby, where the Tomb Raider
OL,9,Ffranchise was created 30 years ago.
OL,11,FThe sculpture was originally part of
OL,12,Fthe Tomb Raider: The LIVE Experience in
OL,13,FCamden, London, but has been in storage
OL,14,Fsince the attraction closed in 2023.
OL,16,FOrganisers hope to raise #30,000 to
OL,17,Fmove the statue to Derby Market Hall
OL,18,Fand create a permanent landmark
OL,19,Fcelebrating the city's role in video
OL,20,Fgame folklore.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
