OL,3,GNEWSAFundraiser to bring 9ft Lara Croft
OL,4,Astatue to city
OL,5,
OL,6,FLuke Earle, who hosts the annual Tomb
OL,7,FRaider Day in Derby, said: "Just as
OL,8,FNottingham has Robin Hood, Derby has
OL,9,FLara Croft, and it would be great to
OL,10,Fhave a statue of her in the city centre
OL,11,Fto remind everyone that she was born
OL,12,Fhere in the city."
